{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_aprot2_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_aprot2_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"那一场戏","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aprot2_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a40ece739f8b4458850b36577051fbb688ee699ebe88e67d26279f82d0f6798c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"暮落总是梦到过去的事。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"天空的颜色很古怪。\n太阳暗淡无光，云朵染着灰色，天幕从远处开始破碎，裂痕向着中心蔓延。\n但这一切在此时都不再重要。\n你还记得这一天。\n你总是忘不掉这一天。\n这一天好似一个注定会来的预言，早已被所有人知晓。\n这一天又像一个无法摆脱的噩梦，从无一刻停止纠缠。\n你已经分不清这是否是一场戏。\n你的生活，或许从来只是他人眼中的一场戏。\n沉渊。\n你问你自己。\n台上的演员只有剧本，可是你呢？\n你要怎么选择？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是做不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，你不该心软。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是我搞砸了我们的计划，其他人也不会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你还有将功抵过的机会，带我的脑袋回去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！别让我后悔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不该心软......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我该如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我应该现在就杀了你，割下你的头，带回领主面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后忍辱负重，等待复仇时机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拿着这个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是，你的匕首......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你，你走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，沉渊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放走了我，你要怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"你又一次做出了选择。\n你已经很清楚自己要怎么做了，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，多谢你这几天帮着照看孩子们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"几个小崽子都说你讲故事讲得好听咧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用谢，老伯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们都很听话，反而是我们借住在这里，给各位添麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不麻烦不麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的村人","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，那我就不耽搁你们干活了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"给小孩讲故事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你和村里人相处得挺不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动动嘴而已，也不费什么功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那也是你有这个耐心，我就不太行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天过得太平静了，任务也没出什么意外，我都不太习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平静一点也很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是希望不要出任何意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你的理想是隐居嘛。我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，沉渊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我这有件礼物要给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礼物？是什么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"球形的重物被丢在你的面前。\n微微腐烂的东西落在地上，发出沉闷的声响。\n“礼物”在地上滚动，最终停在你的脚边。\n那双浑浊无光的眼珠与你对视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我把这家伙的武器也一起带回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这原本是你的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为......什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"被你一时心软放走的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"在你以为自己已经逃离过去的时候，忽然以这种形式出现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，你当时不杀掉他是正确的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正确的，选择？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这让这出戏更精彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，沉渊，这不正是你为剧团完成的剧本吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剧本......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经和剧团没关系了，我早就逃出来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是剧本！这怎么会是剧本？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己的选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么选择？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是......我自己的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没能动手杀了你，这是正确的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道你在烦恼什么，但杀了我，才是最好的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用担太大风险，只要按照安排行事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有什么安排，你不该死在这个时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！我和你一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都能逃出去，这次只要小心一点......只要躲起来，不被抓到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，你冷静一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跑不掉的。最后还能见到你，已经够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住手！停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能拖累你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......骗人的吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再说话的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别演了，起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快起来！再不走就来不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再说话的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你为什么不说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，我们已经没有别的路可走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我，把我的脑袋带回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快杀了我！我们没有太多时间了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像这样，把匕首送入你的心脏，然后看你一点点死去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，没错，就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，你的选择是正确的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......这真的是我的选择吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"什么是选择？\n什么是你？\n“沉渊”的一切都由剧团塑造，你期冀寻找的所谓“自我”......\n真的存在吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会死，我知道你会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的头颅注定会离开脖颈，我只希望它不必落在灰尘里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这一次，这一次我会亲手割下你的头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的预言吗，沉渊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会预言，这是我看到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你死了。就算我放走你，你还是会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也逃了，但我终究还是逃不过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你当然逃不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，就算你藏得再好，也躲不过那些看着你的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是谁在看着我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然是观众们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"观众......观众？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我演砸了，他们只会想要除掉我，为什么还要看着我？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"确实，有人为你在舞台上表现出的心软而感到愤怒，但这也是意料之中的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你我都知道，这正是艺术的魅力所在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好的戏剧，好的演员，理应能够调动他人的情绪，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不是这样，不应该是这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放过你是我自己的选择，不是他们的安排！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的能肯定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你还一直走不出这场噩梦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你明明已经逃离，却还会反复重现那一天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你要尝试各种可能，要将我从那副身躯上割下，带在身边？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沉渊，你在恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放过我，是你唯一一次反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从剧团的手下逃走，花光了你仅有的勇气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“血钻”已经找上门来，你却只能躲藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一直以来，比起害怕他们追上来，你更害怕这一切都是被操纵的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不喜欢别人的目光落在你身上，因为你在担忧，这里根本就不存在一个“真实的自己”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说对了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭上你的嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是我梦中的恶灵，你根本不存在于此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要叫我沉渊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要叫我那个名字！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，可怜的人，你杀不死你的恐惧，你无法让那些疑虑闭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，寻找自我是一种禁忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但它能成就伟大的艺术！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你仍然在为艺术奉献！他们都错误地评价了你，你是一个杰出的演员！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！我不是在演戏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会摆脱你，我会杀死你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会再回任何被安排好的舞台，我早就不是沉渊了，我的一切不是一场戏剧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你的小小决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"破碎的头颅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是沉渊，你是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"暮落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我有点走神了......出什么事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你发什么呆呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么事，就是我刚刚好像听到你和人说话......结果过来一看，你就站在这发呆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你听错了，这里只有我一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暮落","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那可能是我耳朵出问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"■■","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你喊我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？■■啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，这不是你的代号吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不说那些，你看——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我这有件礼物要给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"■■","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"■■","speakerId":"avg_4025_aprot2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礼物？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
